---
import BaseHead from "../components/BaseHead.astro";
import Header from "../components/Header.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
import AccordionItem from "../components/AccordionItem.astro";
import CaseCard from "../components/CaseCard.astro";
import { SITE_TITLE, SITE_DESCRIPTION } from "../consts";
import "../styles/FaceTracker.css";
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <BaseHead title={SITE_TITLE} description={SITE_DESCRIPTION} />
  </head>
  <body>
    <!-- <Header /> -->
    <main>
      <h1 class="title">Andy Zou</h1>

      <div class="face-container">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 640 640" class="circular-labels" aria-hidden="true">
          <defs>
            <!-- Top arc: 9 o'clock → 3 o'clock (through 12) -->
            <path
              id="circle-path-top"
              d="M 30 320 A 290 290 0 0 1 610 320"
              fill="none"></path>
            <!-- Bottom arc: 3 o'clock → 9 o'clock (through 6), opposite direction -->
            <path
              id="circle-path-bottom"
              d="M 30 320 A 290 290 0 0 0 610 320"
              fill="none"></path>
          </defs>
          <!-- NW quadrant -->
          <text class="circle-label">
            <textPath
              href="#circle-path-top"
              startOffset="25%"
              text-anchor="middle">Director</textPath
            >
          </text>
          <!-- NE / top right -->
          <text class="circle-label">
            <textPath
              href="#circle-path-top"
              startOffset="75%"
              text-anchor="middle">Creative</textPath
            >
          </text>
          <!-- SW quadrant -->
          <text class="circle-label">
            <textPath
              href="#circle-path-bottom"
              startOffset="25%"
              text-anchor="middle">Tech Wiz</textPath
            >
          </text>
          <!-- SE quadrant -->
          <text class="circle-label">
            <textPath
              href="#circle-path-bottom"
              startOffset="75%"
              text-anchor="middle">About</textPath
            >
          </text>
        </svg>
        <div
          class="face-tracker"
          id="face"
          data-base-path="/faces/"
          data-debug="true"
        >
        </div>
      </div>

      <AccordionItem title="Director">
        <CaseCard
          id="comedy-central"
          title=""
          imageSrc="/public/blog-placeholder-2.jpg"
          imageAlt="Comedy Central Collage"
          reverse
        >
          From pacing to design, Andy’s guiding star with directing is
          resonating with the audience. Whether it’s building on the latest
          trends or cultural moments, he seeks to connect with the audience on a
          human level.
        </CaseCard>
        <CaseCard
          id="comedy-central"
          title="Comedy Central Digital"
          imageSrc="/public/blog-placeholder-2.jpg"
          imageAlt="Comedy Central Collage"
        >
          As a Social Producer on Comedy Central's Webby-winning digital team,
          Andy spearheaded directing on multiple projects like <i>Mini-Mocks</i
          >, music videos, and other original content collaborations with
          notable influencers.
        </CaseCard>
        <CaseCard
          id="comedy-central"
          title="Comedy Central Digital"
          imageSrc="/public/blog-placeholder-2.jpg"
          imageAlt="Comedy Central Collage"
          reverse
        >
          As a Social Producer on Comedy Central's Webby-winning digital team,
          Andy spearheaded multiple projects like episodes of <i>Mini-Mocks</i>,
          music videos, and other original content collaborations with notable
          influencers.
        </CaseCard>
      </AccordionItem>
      <AccordionItem title="Creative">
        <CaseCard
          id="polygon"
          title="Polygon Labs Spec Spot"
          imageSrc="/public/blog-placeholder-2.jpg"
          imageAlt="Polygon Labs Spec Spot"
        >
          Developed a flagship spot for Polygon Labs, translating his understanding of web3 infrastructure into a relatable concept.
        </CaseCard>
      </AccordionItem>
      <AccordionItem title="Technologist">
        <CaseCard
          id="tech"
          title=""
          imageSrc="/public/blog-placeholder-2.jpg"
          imageAlt="Tech Forward Collage"
          reverse
        >
          With a background in Mathematics & Computer Science, Andy has always
          embraced the technical aspects of production. from coding custom After
          Effects scripts to attempting niche immersive VR workflows, he enjoys
          expanding his capabilities.
        </CaseCard>
        <CaseCard
          id="tech"
          title=""
          imageSrc="/public/blog-placeholder-2.jpg"
          imageAlt="Tech Forward Collage"
        >
          A constant tinkerer, Andy's breadth of experience includes traditional
          3D tools such as Unreal Engine, Unity, Blender, and more.
        </CaseCard>
        <CaseCard
          id="ai"
          title=""
          imageSrc="/public/blog-placeholder-2.jpg"
          imageAlt="AI Collage"
          reverse
        >
          But Andy also knows how to grow with the times, dabbling in AI-driven
          generative workflows from platforms like Higgsfield and Kling to
          API-driven bespoke applications such as ComfyUI and Veo3.
        </CaseCard>
      </AccordionItem>
      <AccordionItem title="Weirdo">
        <CaseCard
          id="personal-projects"
          title="Personal Projects"
          imageSrc="/public/blog-placeholder-2.jpg"
          imageAlt="Personal Projects Collage"
        >
          Having started in the comedy scene, Andy has cultivated a unique voice
          in his personal work, always tapping into absurd humor that still
          manages to resonate on a human level.</CaseCard
        >
      </AccordionItem>
      <Footer />
      <script>
        import "../face-tracker.js";
      </script>
    </main>

    <style>
      .title {
        font-size: 10vw;
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
        font-weight: bold;
      }

      main {
        padding: 1em;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        max-width: 1280px;
        margin: 0 auto;
      }

      /* Container sizes to SVG; face-tracker is overlaid and centered in the circle */
      .face-container {
        position: relative;
        display: none;
        width: min(70vw, 70vh);
        aspect-ratio: 1;
        container-type: size;
      }

      .circular-labels {
        width: 100%;
        height: auto;
        fill: currentColor;
        display: block;
        position: relative;
        z-index: 10;
      }

      .face-container .face-tracker {
        position: absolute;
        top: 50%;
        left: 50%;
        transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
        width: 50%;
        height: 50%;
        border-radius: 50%;
        min-height: 0;
        z-index: 1;
      }

      .circle-label {
        --label-size: 2rem;
        font-size: var(--label-size);
        cursor: default;
        transition: font-size 0.2s ease;
      }
      .circle-label:hover {
        font-size: calc(var(--label-size) * 1.1);
      }
    </style>
  </body>
</html>
